<title>USA: Atlas Air names Rendleman Snr VP.</title>
<headline>Atlas Air names Rendleman Snr VP.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1996-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atlas Air said it has named R. Terrence Rendleman, 51, senior vice president for the newly created post of technical services and flight operations. Rendleman has been senior vice president, maintenance, at United Airlines.</p>
<p>-- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
